    "QH Distribution is a wholesale beauty/personal-care trading company with roughly 40 years in the industry, carrying over 1,000 brands across skincare, makeup, haircare, and body care, and supplying retailers, distributors, spas, and salons in 20+ countries.",
    "Standard payment terms are a 30% deposit with the remaining 70% due before delivery — this is their default, not something specific to your account, so a request to change it is a request for an exception to a standard policy, not a signal something is wrong with the relationship.",
